Meta{protocol:TOON_v3,project:Request-Website-v2.0,document:ACTION_PLAN_v1}:

Phase_1_Foundation{timeline:Week_1-2,owner:Dev_Lead}:
- Task_1.1_ProjectSetup{status:PENDING,effort:1d}
  - Initialize_git_repo_with_main_branch
  - Create_.gitignore_and_README.md
  - Setup_folder_structure(COMPLETED)
  - Document_conventions_in_CONTRIBUTING.md
- Task_1.2_ConfigFiles{status:PENDING,effort:0.5d}
  - Create_site-config.yaml(COMPLETED)
  - Create_colors.yaml_(if_separating_branding)
  - Create_forms-config.yaml_(endpoint_settings)
  - Setup_.env.example_for_sensitive_vars
- Task_1.3_BaseHTML{status:PENDING,effort:1d}
  - Create_src/pages/index.html_(main_landing)
  - Create_src/pages/404.html_(error_page)
  - Setup_base_meta_tags,Open_Graph,structured_data
  - Add_favicon,webmanifest_for_PWA_(optional)
- Task_1.4_BaseCSS{status:PENDING,effort:2d}
  - Create_src/css/reset.css_(or_normalize)
  - Create_src/css/variables.css_(CSS_custom_props_from_config)
  - Create_src/css/base.css_(typography,spacing,components)
  - Create_src/css/sections.css_(full-width,half-height,split_layouts)
  - Create_src/css/forms.css_(input,button,validation_styles)
  - Create_src/css/utilities.css_(spacing,visibility,flexbox_helpers)
  - Create_src/css/responsive.css_(media_queries,mobile-first)
  - Create_src/css/animations.css_(transitions,scroll_snap_anim)

Phase_2_Sections{timeline:Week_2-3,owner:Template_Designer}:
- Task_2.1_HeroSection{status:PENDING,effort:1.5d}
  - Build_hero-section.html_component_(full-width,full-height)
  - Implement_background_video_(muted,loop,fallback_image)
  - Add_CTA_buttons,heading,subheading
  - Mobile_responsive_text_sizing
- Task_2.2_VideoShowcaseSection{status:PENDING,effort:1d}
  - Build_video-showcase.html_(split_layout:video+text)
  - Support_both_modes:bg_loop_or_player_with_controls
  - Add_lazy-loading_intersection_observer
  - Mobile_stack_to_single_column
- Task_2.3_FormSection{status:PENDING,effort:1.5d}
  - Build_join-form.html_component
  - Implement_multi-step_form_if_needed_(step_1:name+email,step_2:project_interests)
  - Add_form_validation_(native_HTML5+light_JS)
  - Honeypot_spam_field
  - Success_confirmation_message_or_modal
- Task_2.4_BenefitsSection{status:PENDING,effort:1d}
  - Build_benefits_grid_(3col_desktop,1col_mobile)
  - Add_icons_or_SVG_graphics
  - Short_copy_per_benefit
- Task_2.5_CTASection{status:PENDING,effort:0.5d}
  - Build_closing_CTA_section_(full-width,centered)
  - Strong_headline+secondary_CTA_button
  - Email_signup_optional
- Task_2.6_Footer{status:PENDING,effort:0.5d}
  - Build_footer_with_links,contact_info
  - Social_media_icons
  - Privacy_policy,terms_links

Phase_3_Interactivity{timeline:Week_3-4,owner:Frontend_Dev}:
- Task_3.1_ScrollSnapping{status:PENDING,effort:1d}
  - Implement_CSS_scroll-snap-type_on_body/main
  - Apply_snap-align_to_sections_(hero,video,form)
  - Test_reduced_motion_prefers-reduced-motion_media_query
  - Optional_JS:IntersectionObserver_for_nav_highlight
- Task_3.2_FormHandling{status:PENDING,effort:1.5d}
  - Choose_backend:
    - Option_A:getform.io_free_tier_(REST_POST)
    - Option_B:CloudflareWorker_(D1_DB_or_KV_store)
    - Option_C:GoogleAppsScript_WebApp_(Google_Sheets_backend)
  - Create_src/js/form-handler.js
  - Implement_HTML5_validation
  - Add_error_display_logic
  - Add_success_toast_or_modal
- Task_3.3_VideoLazyLoading{status:PENDING,effort:0.5d}
  - Add_loading="lazy"_attribute_to_below-fold_videos
  - Setup_IntersectionObserver_for_video.play()_if_needed
  - Test_on_slow_3G
- Task_3.4_SmoothScroll{status:PENDING,effort:0.5d}
  - Add_scroll-behavior:smooth_to_html_in_CSS
  - Implement_anchor_links_(#section-id)
  - Optional_nav_header_with_smooth_scroll_to_sections

Phase_4_Optimization{timeline:Week_4,owner:Perf_Lead}:
- Task_4.1_ImageOptimization{status:PENDING,effort:1d}
  - Run_all_images_through_TinyPNG,ImageOptim,or_Squoosh
  - Create_WebP+AVIF_versions_with_JPEG_fallback
  - Add_responsive_images_with_srcset(1x,2x,3x)
  - Optimize_poster_images_for_videos
- Task_4.2_CSSMinification{status:PENDING,effort:0.5d}
  - Generate_minified_CSS_if_not_automating_(cssnano,PurgeCSS)
  - Inline_critical_CSS_for_above-fold_content_(optional)
  - Remove_unused_CSS_classes
- Task_4.3_JSMinification{status:PENDING,effort:0.5d}
  - Minify_form-handler.js_and_scroll_scripts
  - Tree-shake_unused_code
- Task_4.4_Fonts{status:PENDING,effort:0.5d}
  - Use_system_fonts_or_Google_Fonts_with_font-display:swap
  - Preload_critical_fonts_in_<head>
  - Subset_fonts_to_latin_or_specific_language
- Task_4.5_LightHouse_Audit{status:PENDING,effort:0.5d}
  - Run_Lighthouse_CI_locally
  - Ensure_LCP<2.5s,FID<100ms,CLS<0.1
  - Performance_score_>90
  - Accessibility_score_>95
  - SEO_score_>95

Phase_5_A11y_SEO{timeline:Concurrent_Weeks_2-4,owner:QA_Lead}:
- Task_5.1_Accessibility{status:PENDING,effort:1.5d}
  - Run_axe_DevTools_on_every_page
  - Ensure_color_contrast_4.5:1_body_text,3:1_large_text
  - Add_ARIA_labels_to_form_inputs,icon_buttons
  - Test_keyboard_navigation_(Tab,Enter,Escape)
  - Ensure_focus_indicators_visible_on_all_buttons
  - Add_skip-to-main_link_(hidden,focusable)
  - Test_with_screen_reader_(VoiceOver_Mac,NVDA_Windows)
- Task_5.2_SEO_Setup{status:PENDING,effort:1d}
  - Create_meta_descriptions_(155_chars_max)
  - Setup_Open_Graph_tags_(title,desc,image,url)
  - Generate_robots.txt_and_sitemap.xml
  - Setup_Google_Analytics_or_Plausible_tracking_code
  - Test_with_Google_Mobile_Friendly_Test
  - Verify_structured_data_(schema.org_Organization)
- Task_5.3_Mobile_Testing{status:PENDING,effort:1d}
  - Test_on_real_iOS_12.2+_devices
  - Test_on_real_Android_10+_devices
  - Check_touch_target_sizes_(48x48px_minimum)
  - Ensure_form_inputs_don't_trigger_zoom_on_focus
  - Test_video_playback_on_slow_3G

Phase_6_Deployment{timeline:Week_5,owner:DevOps_Lead}:
- Task_6.1_ChooseHosting{status:PENDING,effort:0.5d}
  - Decision:Cloudflare_Pages_vs_Vercel_vs_GitHub_Pages
  - Pros/Cons:
    - Cloudflare_Pages:Free,fast,has_Workers_for_forms,zero_config
    - Vercel:Free,fast,preview_deployments,form_integration_paid
    - GitHub_Pages:Free,simple,limited_dynamic_features
  - Recommended:Cloudflare_Pages+Workers_for_form_backend
- Task_6.2_DomainSetup{status:PENDING,effort:0.5d}
  - Register_domain_or_update_DNS
  - Setup_CNAME_or_A_record_pointing_to_host
  - Enable_HTTPS_(automatic_with_CF,Vercel)
  - Setup_email_forwarding_or_MX_records
- Task_6.3_FormBackend{status:PENDING,effort:1d}
  - Setup_chosen_form_endpoint_(getform.io,CF_Worker,GoogleAppsScript)
  - Create_notification_email_template
  - Test_end-to-end_form_submission
  - Setup_redirect_after_success_(or_same_page_modal)
- Task_6.4_Analytics{status:PENDING,effort:0.5d}
  - Create_Plausible_or_GA4_account
  - Add_tracking_script_to_<head>
  - Setup_goal_tracking_for_form_submission
  - Setup_goal_tracking_for_video_plays
  - Test_in_incognito_mode
- Task_6.5_SSL_Security{status:PENDING,effort:0.5d}
  - Ensure_HTTPS_enforced_(redirect_http_to_https)
  - Setup_security_headers_(CSP,X-Frame-Options,etc)
  - Test_with_Mozilla_Observatory
- Task_6.6_DNSandCDN{status:PENDING,effort:0.5d}
  - Verify_DNS_propagation_(use_dig_or_nslookup)
  - Enable_Cloudflare_caching_rules_if_CF
  - Setup_cache_headers_for_static_assets_(max-age:31536000)

Phase_7_Testing_QA{timeline:Week_5,owner:QA_Team}:
- Task_7.1_BrowserCompat{status:PENDING,effort:1d}
  - Test_Chrome_latest_2_versions
  - Test_Firefox_latest_2_versions
  - Test_Safari_latest_2_versions
  - Test_Edge_latest_2_versions
  - Use_BrowserStack_or_CanIUse_for_reference
- Task_7.2_ResponsiveDesign{status:PENDING,effort:1d}
  - Test_viewport_sizes:
    - 320px_(iPhone_SE)
    - 768px_(iPad)
    - 1024px_(iPad_Pro)
    - 1440px_(Desktop)
    - 1920px_(Desktop_4K)
  - Ensure_text_readable,images_load,buttons_clickable
- Task_7.3_FormTesting{status:PENDING,effort:1d}
  - Submit_valid_form_data
  - Test_validation_errors_(empty_fields,invalid_email)
  - Test_honeypot_spam_protection
  - Verify_email_notification_arrives
  - Test_success_message_displays
  - Test_form_clear_on_success
- Task_7.4_VideoTesting{status:PENDING,effort:0.5d}
  - Test_hero_video_autoplay_on_desktop
  - Test_hero_video_paused_on_mobile_(bandwidth_saving)
  - Test_video_controls_on_player_section
  - Test_lazy_loading_of_below-fold_videos
  - Test_fallback_poster_image_displays_while_loading
- Task_7.5_LinkTesting{status:PENDING,effort:0.5d}
  - Verify_all_internal_links_work
  - Verify_external_links_open_in_new_tab
  - Test_anchor_links_(scroll_to_#section-id)
- Task_7.6_FormTesting_Edge_Cases{status:PENDING,effort:0.5d}
  - Test_on_slow_network_3G_with_DevTools_throttling
  - Test_form_submission_on_spotty_connection
  - Test_video_buffering_on_slow_network
  - Test_offline_behavior_(service_worker_optional)

Phase_8_Launch_Prep{timeline:Week_5,owner:Product_Lead}:
- Task_8.1_Copywriting{status:PENDING,effort:1d}
  - Finalize_hero_headline,subheading
  - Finalize_form_CTA_copy
  - Finalize_benefits_section_copy
  - Finalize_footer_links,social_handles
  - Proofread_for_grammar,brand_voice
- Task_8.2_ImagesVideo{status:PENDING,effort:1.5d}
  - Source_or_shoot_hero_video_(or_use_stock)
  - Source_section_images_(or_placeholder_until_content_ready)
  - Create_video_poster_images_(thumbnail_for_before_play)
  - Create_OG_image_(1200x630px_for_social_sharing)
  - Compress_all_images_before_upload
- Task_8.3_Documentation{status:PENDING,effort:1d}
  - Write_README.md_(project_overview,setup_instructions)
  - Write_CONTRIBUTING.md_(git_workflow,code_style)
  - Write_DEPLOYMENT.md_(how_to_deploy_changes)
  - Create_CHANGELOG.md_(v1.0_initial_release)
  - Create_API_ENDPOINTS.md_if_using_form_backend
- Task_8.4_RedirectSetup{status:PENDING,effort:0.5d}
  - Setup_301_redirects_for_old_URLs_if_migrating
  - Setup_404_custom_page
  - Setup_robots.txt_to_disallow_staging_URL
- Task_8.5_Monitor_Setup{status:PENDING,effort:0.5d}
  - Setup_Uptime_Kuma_or_Pingdom_for_uptime_monitoring
  - Setup_error_alerting_in_analytics
  - Setup_form_submission_failure_alerts

Phase_9_Launch{timeline:Day_35,owner:Release_Manager}:
- Task_9.1_FinalChecklist{status:PENDING,effort:0.5d}
  - [ ] All_Lighthouse_scores_>90
  - [ ] All_form_submissions_working
  - [ ] All_videos_play_smoothly
  - [ ] All_pages_mobile_responsive
  - [ ] Analytics_tracking_verified
  - [ ] HTTPS_enforced
  - [ ] 404_page_works
  - [ ] SEO_meta_tags_complete
  - [ ] Privacy_policy_accessible
  - [ ] No_console_errors_in_DevTools
- Task_9.2_Deploy{status:PENDING,effort:0.5h}
  - Push_to_main_branch_or_trigger_production_build
  - Verify_site_live_and_accessible
  - Smoke_test_on_live_domain
- Task_9.3_PostLaunchMonitoring{status:PENDING,effort:ongoing}
  - Monitor_Lighthouse_scores_daily_first_week
  - Monitor_form_submission_volume
  - Monitor_uptime_and_error_logs
  - Monitor_analytics_visitor_metrics
  - Prepare_to_respond_to_user_feedback

Phase_10_PostLaunch_Iteration{timeline:Week_6+,owner:Product_Team}:
- Task_10.1_AnalyticsReview{status:PENDING,effort:weekly}
  - Analyze_visitor_behavior,bounce_rates,form_conversion
  - Identify_underperforming_sections
  - A/B_test_CTA_copy_if_tools_available
- Task_10.2_UserFeedback{status:PENDING,effort:ongoing}
  - Collect_form_data_and_support_emails
  - Address_bugs_or_usability_issues
  - Create_GitHub_Issues_for_improvements
- Task_10.3_ContentUpdates{status:PENDING,effort:monthly}
  - Update_project_counts_and_statistics
  - Refresh_testimonials_or_case_studies
  - Update_footer_social_links,contact_info
- Task_10.4_PerfMonitoring{status:PENDING,effort:ongoing}
  - Monthly_Lighthouse_audit
  - Monitor_Core_Web_Vitals_in_Google_Analytics
  - Optimize_if_metrics_degrade

Dependencies_and_Blockers:
- Form_backend_decision_blocks:Task_3.2,Task_6.3
- Content_ready_blocks:Task_8.2,Task_2.x
- Domain_ready_blocks:Task_6.2,Task_6.6
- Design_assets_blocks:Task_4.1,Task_8.2

Success_Criteria:
- Site_live_at_request-climate.com
- Form_submission_working_with_email_notifications
- Lighthouse_Performance>90,Accessibility>95,SEO>95
- Mobile_responsive_on_320px-1920px
- LCP<2.5s,FID<100ms,CLS<0.1
- All_WCAG_2.1_AA_standards_met
- 100%_form_submission_success_rate_on_launch_week
- Analytics_installed_and_tracking_correctly

Timeline_Summary:
- Phase_1_Foundation:2d
- Phase_2_Sections:5d
- Phase_3_Interactivity:3d
- Phase_4_Optimization:2d
- Phase_5_A11y_SEO:3d_(concurrent_2-4)
- Phase_6_Deployment:2d
- Phase_7_Testing_QA:3d
- Phase_8_Launch_Prep:3d_(concurrent_with_testing)
- Phase_9_Launch:1d
- Phase_10_PostLaunch:ongoing
- TOTAL:~5-6_weeks_for_full_launch

Risks_and_Mitigation:
- Risk:Form_backend_downtime
  - Mitigation:Use_redundant_backend_(email+getform.io)
- Risk:Video_loading_too_slow
  - Mitigation:Lazy-load_below-fold_videos,short_durations
- Risk:Mobile_performance_degradation
  - Mitigation:Disable_autoplay_on_mobile,lazy_load_images
- Risk:Accessibility_standards_missed
  - Mitigation:Weekly_axe_DevTools_audits,screen_reader_testing
- Risk:Form_spam
  - Mitigation:Honeypot_field,rate_limiting_on_backend

Notes:
- All_CSS_and_JS_should_remain_framework-free_for_simplicity_and_fast_load_times
- Keep_dependencies_minimal_(no_webpack,gulp,npm_unless_adding_complexity_justified)
- Focus_on_static_HTML+CSS+minimal_JS_for_fastest_load_times
- Document_every_config_change_in_commit_messages
- Review_and_close_GitHub_Issues_weekly